| Gonzalo Rodriguez | 59 | 17.8% | 24 | 2026-03-09 | active |
| Divya Rao | 53 | 16.0% | 1 | 2026-01-28 | active |
| Hye-jin Park | 31 | 9.3% | 2 | 2026-02-20 | active |
| Brad Lindsay | 25 | 7.5% | 1 | 2018-02-06 | inactive |

- **Who to ask:** Gonzalo Rodriguez. They hold the most lines of anyone still working on this code. They also made 24 commits to it, far more than anyone else, and the latest was on 2026-03-09.
- **Why not hakanensari:** They hold the most lines overall, but they made one commit in 2014 and are inactive. Treat that as the original author's code, not as someone to contact. Their share is 16.6% (55 lines) without copy detection.
- **Who to ask to review:** The tool's line-ranked top three are hakanensari, Gonzalo Rodriguez and Divya Rao. Since hakanensari is inactive, the three active owners by lines are Gonzalo Rodriguez, Divya Rao and Hye-jin Park. Divya Rao has one commit but 53 surviving lines, so they probably wrote one of the larger proxy files.
